{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/15/6585100/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46時間テレビ終わりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんご軍団のロケには\nいろいろ事情があり\n混ぜて貰えませんでしたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタジオで孤軍奮闘しました！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにこの写真は\nデパートの屋上ステージで\n踊ってみた動画を撮った日のものです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「何度目の軍団か？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっちゅん作詞の替え歌が\n流石すぎて。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんご軍団、\n武道館目指します♡(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は人の写真ばっかり撮っていたら\n自分の写真撮るの忘れてました！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの写真を撮るという\n任務を果たせたと思っています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木恋などで使われると思うので\nお楽しみに(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも1枚だけ特別に先行公開！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/15/6585100/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいい～～（ ;  ; ）♡\n七瀬さんの電視台に出演していた\nトカゲちゃんです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいかった（ ;  ; ）♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"主に私が出演したのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎乃木坂電視台\n◎ガチ歌合戦\n◎2期生生誕祭\n◎3日目のMC代打"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じでしょうか(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★乃木坂電視台では今回は\nどうぶつ将棋をやりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/15/6585100/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★ガチ歌合戦では東京事変さんの\n群青日和を歌いました！\n学生時代バンドで歌った想い出の曲。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに選曲の時に悩んだのは\nポケビさん、シャカラビさん、\n阿部真央さん、SCANDALさんなど！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★2期生生誕祭を開いていただきました！\n今と変わらず歌が好きで、\n今と変わらず運動神経が悪い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服飾の専門学校に行っている頃の\n髪がグレーっぽい時代の写メも\n載せたんだけど気づいたかな？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★3日目はみなみちゃんの代わりに\nMC代打をしたり、VTRが届かず\nバタバタしているのを\n二期生みんなで繋ぎました！\n頑張った！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして黒板アート！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/15/6585100/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"数人でやる予定だったんだけど、\n生放送でバタバタしていて、\n他のメンバーはスタジオで出演しなくては\nならなくなってしまったので\n私とまいちゅんでほぼ頑張りましたー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"草プロと化したまいちゅん。(笑)\n私はローファーを頑張りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/15/6585100/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴プロ(^o^)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/15/6585100/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46時間テレビはかなり大変だけど\n達成感はあるし\nメンバーの仲も深まるので\nすごく好きです(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またいつかできたらいいなと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご覧いただいた\n皆さんありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/15/6585100/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}